### 图书借阅管理系统 - 接口示例
### 适用于 IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code REST Client
### 使用顺序：先执行「登录」拿到 token，再执行其余请求。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = 请粘贴登录接口返回的 accessToken

### 1. 注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "charlie",
  "password": "charlie123",
  "fullName": "Charlie",
  "email": "charlie@library.local"
}

### 2. 登录（管理员）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3. 当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 分页检索图书（公开）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books?page=0&size=10&sort=title,asc
Accept: application/json

### 5. 新增图书（ADMIN / LIBRARIAN）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9787111213826",
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "publisher": "机械工业出版社",
  "publishYear": 2018,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "totalCopies": 3,
  "description": "Java 编程最佳实践"
}

### 6. 借书
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/borrows
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1
}

### 7. 我的借阅记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrows/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 续借
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/borrows/1/renew
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 还书
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/borrows/1/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 统计信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 全部分类
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 12. 用户列表（ADMIN）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
